     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hello,<div><br></div><div>Thanks for the reply. </div><div><br></div><div>I indeed didnt provide much detail, because the model seems to fit fine using the for loop. Nevertheless I did everything manually just now, and I get zero convergence issues or anything like that. It&#39;s only when using the interating functions like map and lapply! </div><div><br></div><div>I&#39;m fitting a model on 16 items about emotions/mood. I have 2 latent factors, 8 items on each factor. Sample size per groups differs between 190 and 400.</div><div><br></div><div><br></div></div><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"></div>"
